WEBVTT

00:07:02.083 --> 00:07:04.809
We also practice du-rag diplomacy.

00:07:04.833 --> 00:07:06.393
(Laughter)

00:07:06.417 --> 00:07:10.518
Because, we don't edit who we are
when we do our thing.

00:07:10.542 --> 00:07:11.851
Due to our appearance,

00:07:11.875 --> 00:07:14.684
we often get mistaken
for rappers or athletes.

00:07:14.708 --> 00:07:16.976
It happened here last year at TED.

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:18.643
This dude ran down on me

00:07:18.667 --> 00:07:20.667
and asked me when I was going to perform.

00:07:21.458 --> 00:07:22.893
How about now?

00:07:22.917 --> 00:07:27.583
(Applause)